# PoultryPro Environment Configuration

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Supabase Backend Configuration (Recommended for Production & Online Mode)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# Execute the SQL schema in supabase/migrations/20261024_initial_schema.sql
# In your Supabase Dashboard: Project Settings > API > copy Project URL and anon public key.
# Also set these two variables in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# Optional existing profile image bucket; no bucket is created automatically.
# Inspect/review supabase/optional/setup_profile_images.sql before configuring Storage.
# VITE_PROFILE_AVATAR_BUCKET=avatars

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Legacy / Local Express Backend (Optional fallback)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If running the local Node.js Express + MySQL backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# Official business support details are centralized in src/config/supportContact.js.
